title: Proposition 93
---
order: 93
---
short_label: X.93
---
sections:

#### prop_section ####
kind: proposition
----
statement: If an area is contained by a rational straight line and a third apotome, then the side of the area is a second apotome of a medial straight line.
----
proof:

Let the area *AB* be contained by the rational straight line *AC* and the third apotome *AD*.

I say that the side of the area *AB* is a second apotome of a medial straight line.

